<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Gannett.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential ups Gannett.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential has upgraded Gannett Co Inc's rating to buy from hold, a source at the firm said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
